<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses balance sheet to be discussed..</title>
<headline>EU molasses balance sheet to be discussed..</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will on Wednesday discuss the molasses balance for 1995/96, an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Committee will discuss the final molasses balance sheet for 1995/96,&quot; the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
